WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:24.332 --> 00:00:26.582
Cosplayer: Wakanda forever!

00:00:35.996 --> 00:00:37.635
Cosplayer: Well, let me
tell you something, dude.

00:00:37.635 --> 00:00:39.985
You'd better come down
here to C2E2, brother!

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.540
Cosplayer: I think this is
version three of everything

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.240
on this costume, and I'm
finally happy with it.

00:01:07.604 --> 00:01:09.121
Harley Quinn: Something tells
me a whole lot of people

00:01:09.121 --> 00:01:10.538
are about to die.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.511
Cosplayer: Everybody
laugh at Moaning Myrtle!

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:37.112
10 points to get it through her stomach,

00:01:37.112 --> 00:01:39.512
50 if you get it through her head!

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.148
Cosplayer: I keep getting
those looks, all day.

00:01:59.148 --> 00:02:01.889
I walk by, and people are like, "Whoa!"

00:02:05.009 --> 00:02:07.242
Cosplayer: Smoke, good!

00:02:15.332 --> 00:02:17.853
Cosplayer: Storm,
mistress of the elements,

00:02:17.853 --> 00:02:20.786
and I command you to release that child!

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:30.027
Cosplayer: The wings took about two weeks,

00:02:30.027 --> 00:02:32.110
this guy was, like, a two-day build,

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.050
and this was a one-day build.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.472
Goes like that. [laughs]

00:02:47.163 --> 00:02:49.680
Cosplayer: Bakugo, from
"My Hero Academia."

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:50.850
Cosplayer: I made the wig myself,

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.560
and I used expanding
foam for the pigtails.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.890
And then I had to screw
them into the wig cap,

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.590
so it took probably about
three months, probably more.

